WEBVTT

00:00:06.550 --> 00:00:10.330
Yasuko, we're taking off.

00:00:10.330 --> 00:00:13.350
When you're done getting ready, come
with everyone in the car and join us.

00:00:13.350 --> 00:00:14.790
What about Kazusa-chan?

00:00:14.790 --> 00:00:17.000
She's been gone for a while now.

00:00:21.520 --> 00:00:24.700
Honey, the car service is almost here.

00:00:24.700 --> 00:00:25.880
Yeah...

00:00:25.880 --> 00:00:28.420
What is it? Are you still jetlagged?

00:00:41.780 --> 00:00:45.610
Nice weather today, huh?

00:02:27.370 --> 00:02:29.150
You know...

00:02:29.150 --> 00:02:32.690
You spend every Sunday doing nothing.

00:02:32.690 --> 00:02:35.040
Summer vacation is over.
Hit the books!

00:02:35.420 --> 00:02:37.630
After all we did to get you into Matsuoka,

00:02:37.630 --> 00:02:40.110
I don't want to see your grades slip.

00:02:40.110 --> 00:02:42.010
Honey, you too. Wake up!

00:02:42.010 --> 00:02:43.210
Breakfast's ready.

00:02:53.790 --> 00:02:56.060
Akira Okudaira

00:02:55.400 --> 00:02:57.680
You eat up too, Fumi.

00:03:00.780 --> 00:03:02.040
Yes, Mother.

00:03:04.760 --> 00:03:06.080
You didn't forget anything, right?

00:03:06.530 --> 00:03:07.520
Yup.

00:03:07.720 --> 00:03:09.200
Did you bring the present?

00:03:09.200 --> 00:03:10.130
Yup.

00:03:10.570 --> 00:03:12.450
What about your cellphone? Keep
it off during the ceremony-

00:03:12.450 --> 00:03:13.960
Enough already!

00:03:13.960 --> 00:03:16.100
I'm not a little kid!

00:03:19.840 --> 00:03:20.800
Huh?

00:03:20.800 --> 00:03:21.930
What is it?!

00:03:23.500 --> 00:03:24.760
The school.

00:03:24.760 --> 00:03:27.320
Yeah. They're putting a new building in.

00:03:27.320 --> 00:03:28.800
New building?

00:03:28.800 --> 00:03:30.520
The school building was getting pretty old,

00:03:30.520 --> 00:03:32.530
so they're building a new one.

00:03:46.060 --> 00:03:48.030
Don't cry, Yacchan.

00:03:48.490 --> 00:03:49.870
I won't.

00:03:50.250 --> 00:03:53.700
You'll be in tears. I know it.

00:03:53.700 --> 00:03:56.040
How can you be so sure?

00:03:56.470 --> 00:03:59.850
Because you're a delicate flower, Yacchan.

00:04:04.130 --> 00:04:08.430
You really look good dressed like that.

00:04:10.040 --> 00:04:11.580
You and Kuri are both the

00:04:11.580 --> 00:04:14.730
"prince" types, which makes you
popular. It must be a pain.

00:04:15.340 --> 00:04:18.210
Because of that, everyone
gets the wrong idea.

00:04:19.020 --> 00:04:22.390
Hey, turn that frown upside
down and congratulate me.

00:04:22.390 --> 00:04:25.900
I'll tell you a secret that'll
lift your spirits right away:

00:04:26.510 --> 00:04:31.310
I can't cross the threshold until
you've congratulated me.

00:04:35.280 --> 00:04:37.090
Thanks for escorting me here.

00:04:37.700 --> 00:04:39.710
Call me when it's done.

00:04:39.710 --> 00:04:41.590
You don't have to wait for me.

00:04:42.000 --> 00:04:44.000
I don't even know how long it'll be.

00:04:44.280 --> 00:04:47.090
It's fine. I'll find a way to pass the time.

00:04:50.160 --> 00:04:51.500
Ikumi-san!

00:04:53.250 --> 00:04:54.560
Okudaira-san.

00:04:54.560 --> 00:04:56.490
Oh, hello.

00:04:57.790 --> 00:04:58.820
Hey!

00:05:00.330 --> 00:05:02.030
You're going to the wedding?

00:05:02.030 --> 00:05:02.850
Yeah.

00:05:02.850 --> 00:05:04.190
Uh, no, you aren't!

00:05:04.190 --> 00:05:07.610
Why are you even here? You've
got nothing to do with this!

00:05:07.920 --> 00:05:11.510
What's the problem? I'm your
guardian today, after all.

00:05:11.510 --> 00:05:13.300
You're coming too, right, Sawanoi-san?

00:05:13.300 --> 00:05:15.270
Oh no, I'm...

00:05:15.270 --> 00:05:17.770
Geez! Leave already!

00:05:17.770 --> 00:05:20.040
Energetic as usual, I see, Achan.

00:05:21.180 --> 00:05:22.360
Sempai!

00:05:24.310 --> 00:05:26.820
Th-Thank you kindly for your invitation...

00:05:26.820 --> 00:05:31.170
Umm, on this most blessed of days, err...

00:05:31.170 --> 00:05:32.740
Congratulations!

00:05:33.830 --> 00:05:35.050
Thank you.

00:05:36.130 --> 00:05:37.410
Who's that?

00:05:37.410 --> 00:05:39.530
I'm Akira Okudaira's older brother.

00:05:40.210 --> 00:05:41.730
This is Ko Sawanoi-san.

00:05:42.080 --> 00:05:43.520
Kyoko's boyfriend?

00:05:44.020 --> 00:05:45.950
Her fiancé, in name only.

00:05:46.220 --> 00:05:48.050
I'm Yasuko Sugimoto.

00:05:48.050 --> 00:05:51.380
Would you like to attend the
ceremony, perchance?

00:05:51.580 --> 00:05:52.400
Uh...

00:05:52.400 --> 00:05:55.950
Are you sure? Thank you so much then!

00:05:55.950 --> 00:05:57.670
But, Sempai...

00:05:58.660 --> 00:06:01.630
The more the merrier, don't you think?

00:06:02.050 --> 00:06:05.450
Thank you from the bottom of my heart.

00:06:07.040 --> 00:06:09.060
OK, it's over this way.

00:06:16.000 --> 00:06:18.340
Go home as soon as it's over.

00:06:18.340 --> 00:06:20.640
How self-centered are you?

00:06:23.650 --> 00:06:25.590
Thanks for coming.

00:06:28.390 --> 00:06:30.120
Is that a drawing?

00:06:30.120 --> 00:06:32.220
She was the one who taught
me how to draw.

00:06:32.500 --> 00:06:33.820
Oh?

00:06:34.610 --> 00:06:37.550
I guess they're both former
teachers of yours, huh?

00:06:40.790 --> 00:06:44.810
That sort of outfit really does
look good on you, Sempai.

00:06:47.730 --> 00:06:50.300
Kazusa-chan said the same thing.

00:06:53.660 --> 00:06:55.040
You heading out?

00:06:55.040 --> 00:06:58.170
Yeah. I was gonna go for a short walk.

00:07:15.190 --> 00:07:17.070
I wonder if she's still sleeping.

00:07:20.400 --> 00:07:23.460
That Yacchan is so brave.

00:07:23.890 --> 00:07:26.960
Here I was worried if she'd even come,

00:07:26.960 --> 00:07:29.030
and she's not only here,
but acting cheerful!

00:07:29.030 --> 00:07:32.320
The waterworks would start, if she wasn't.

00:07:32.320 --> 00:07:34.630
There you go again, being mean.

00:07:34.630 --> 00:07:37.120
I can't help it if it's true.

00:07:38.480 --> 00:07:41.410
Thanks for coming. You should rest a bit.

00:07:41.640 --> 00:07:42.780
Yeah.

00:07:42.780 --> 00:07:46.370
Did you say hi to our new
brother-in-law yet?

00:07:46.650 --> 00:07:48.540
I will in just a bit.

00:07:48.540 --> 00:07:50.740
Did you?

00:07:51.220 --> 00:07:52.400
Of course.

00:07:52.630 --> 00:07:54.960
Don't cry during the ceremony.

00:07:54.960 --> 00:07:55.750
I beg your pardon?

00:07:56.560 --> 00:07:58.410
You were in love with him.

00:08:02.550 --> 00:08:04.360
Kazusa!

00:08:04.650 --> 00:08:07.220
OK, I'm gonna go say hi.

00:08:08.870 --> 00:08:12.530
So the three of you were
fighting over one man?

00:08:12.530 --> 00:08:15.510
How unlucky for you, as sisters!

00:08:15.850 --> 00:08:17.720
A letter from Kuri-san?

00:08:18.100 --> 00:08:19.970
I never got it.

00:08:21.220 --> 00:08:24.400
Oh. I guess she wasn't able to send it.

00:08:25.040 --> 00:08:26.400
That's kind of a letdown.

00:08:27.180 --> 00:08:30.110
I feel blessed to have three
beautiful sisters after me.

00:08:30.670 --> 00:08:33.440
Hey, you think like a creepy old guy.

00:08:33.440 --> 00:08:35.530
Don't be so mean.

00:08:35.530 --> 00:08:38.070
You're so dull, Sensei.

00:08:38.070 --> 00:08:39.170
Hey...

00:08:39.340 --> 00:08:42.350
Maybe my family just can't resist dull guys.

00:08:43.190 --> 00:08:46.040
Well, sorry for being dull.

00:08:47.680 --> 00:08:49.540
Are you going dressed like that?

00:08:51.450 --> 00:08:52.480
Something wrong?

00:08:52.480 --> 00:08:55.150
No. I mean, it looks great on you.

00:08:56.480 --> 00:08:57.950
It's cool, but...

00:08:57.950 --> 00:09:01.840
You look good in cute, girly clothes too.

00:09:02.530 --> 00:09:04.750
You <i>do</i> think like a creepy old guy.

00:09:04.750 --> 00:09:07.640
Sorry. That might be true.

00:09:09.740 --> 00:09:11.310
You're still saying those things?

00:09:20.260 --> 00:09:20.960
Oh!

00:09:21.310 --> 00:09:22.560
What is it?

00:09:22.560 --> 00:09:24.420
It looks like Fumi-chan tried to call me.

00:09:24.890 --> 00:09:27.050
You didn't tell her about today?

00:09:28.600 --> 00:09:30.970
I had a hard time bringing it up...

00:10:17.800 --> 00:10:18.880
You should cry.

00:10:19.130 --> 00:10:21.000
Huh? Me?

00:10:21.000 --> 00:10:21.760
Yeah.

00:10:22.110 --> 00:10:24.990
Just because you found an
old love-letter of mine,

00:10:24.990 --> 00:10:27.380
don't think you've found
a weakpoint of mine.

00:10:27.380 --> 00:10:29.640
It was just a youthful indiscretion.

00:10:31.180 --> 00:10:33.760
I looked him in the eye and said it.

00:10:33.760 --> 00:10:37.500
That makes me better than someone
who never sent the letter.

00:10:37.500 --> 00:10:40.610
It's not about who's better or worse.

00:10:40.970 --> 00:10:43.170
It's just a nice memory for both of you.

00:10:43.170 --> 00:10:43.770
Right?

00:10:43.770 --> 00:10:45.080
A pretty casual thing to say, no?

00:10:45.080 --> 00:10:47.330
Well, it's not <i>my</i> problem.

00:10:47.650 --> 00:10:50.050
You've got a bad personality, Shinako-chan.

00:10:50.050 --> 00:10:52.580
Think of it like shock therapy.

00:10:54.600 --> 00:10:58.940
Look, here comes the huntress
who beat you two to the prize.

00:11:06.530 --> 00:11:09.990
Kazusa-chan looks beautiful.

00:11:40.890 --> 00:11:41.930
Congratulations.

00:11:53.510 --> 00:11:54.640
Enoshima?!

00:11:56.200 --> 00:11:58.810
What?! I'll come join you now!

00:11:59.460 --> 00:12:02.400
My brother's here, so I'll
get him to drive me.

00:12:02.400 --> 00:12:03.740
Huh? You don't have to...

00:12:03.950 --> 00:12:05.420
Don't worry about it.

00:12:05.420 --> 00:12:07.470
So, where should we meet?

00:12:07.870 --> 00:12:08.670
OK.

00:12:10.280 --> 00:12:11.530
Yeah, good idea.

00:12:12.320 --> 00:12:15.600
All right, I'll be waiting at the entrance
to Bentenbashi bridge.

00:12:15.600 --> 00:12:18.620
Uh, umm... Hold on a sec.

00:12:18.620 --> 00:12:19.340
Hmm?

00:12:59.590 --> 00:13:00.520
Fumi.

00:13:04.490 --> 00:13:07.290
Sorry, I tagged along.

00:13:11.380 --> 00:13:12.780
Long time no see.

00:13:13.700 --> 00:13:14.710
Yeah.

00:13:16.400 --> 00:13:17.490
Umm...

00:13:17.710 --> 00:13:18.570
Hmm?

00:13:19.080 --> 00:13:23.070
Today was your sister's wedding
ceremony, right?

00:13:23.850 --> 00:13:25.610
Congratulations.

00:13:26.700 --> 00:13:27.920
Thank you.

00:13:45.370 --> 00:13:48.350
We have to figure out what we're
going to eat there, Achan.

00:13:48.830 --> 00:13:50.370
Yeah...

00:13:53.840 --> 00:13:55.350
Sorry.

00:13:55.960 --> 00:13:56.970
It's OK.

00:13:57.910 --> 00:14:00.780
And my brother tagged along, too.

00:14:01.220 --> 00:14:04.440
So you ask me to be your chauffeur
and then tell me to leave?

00:14:07.280 --> 00:14:11.380
I'm walking with Fumi-chan!
You two do whatever you want!

00:14:12.620 --> 00:14:15.420
Achan's full of energy, huh?

00:14:15.420 --> 00:14:18.140
Full of stubbornness, you mean.

00:14:18.140 --> 00:14:19.920
Still, she's a good girl.

00:14:20.430 --> 00:14:24.620
Well, her personality is
her only saving grace.

00:14:25.080 --> 00:14:28.080
What was she like as a kid?

00:14:28.480 --> 00:14:30.220
Oh, well...

00:14:30.710 --> 00:14:34.070
She used to follow me everywhere,
like a chick following its mother.

00:14:34.340 --> 00:14:36.990
Right when I started going
to elementary school,

00:14:36.990 --> 00:14:38.750
there she was, every morning, in tears...

00:14:38.750 --> 00:14:41.850
"Don't leave me, brother!"

00:14:40.680 --> 00:14:41.850
Shut it!

00:14:47.320 --> 00:14:51.830
Let me walk with you and then he'll stop.

00:14:53.700 --> 00:14:55.080
No!

00:14:56.350 --> 00:14:59.740
I don't want to walk with you, Sempai.

00:14:59.740 --> 00:15:02.150
Please don't put Achan in a tough spot.

00:15:02.700 --> 00:15:05.260
OK. I'm sorry.

00:15:18.200 --> 00:15:21.540
Fumi-chan got really angry back there.

00:15:22.770 --> 00:15:24.940
Yeah, but can you blame her?

00:15:26.090 --> 00:15:29.420
I did something to piss her off.

00:15:29.740 --> 00:15:32.220
Oh, I see.

00:15:35.200 --> 00:15:39.150
Fumi and I used to date.

00:15:39.490 --> 00:15:40.600
Oh?

00:15:42.230 --> 00:15:46.340
The way I dumped her was pretty nasty.

00:15:47.250 --> 00:15:50.080
I guess you would be surprised by this, huh?

00:15:52.240 --> 00:15:54.550
I think that's normal.

00:15:56.170 --> 00:16:00.480
I'd be shocked if I was
in your shoes, too.

00:16:08.710 --> 00:16:12.960
You really look good dressed like that.

00:16:14.140 --> 00:16:19.060
When I first met him, they were
already dating a long time.

00:16:23.320 --> 00:16:27.540
What was I thinking? I hacked my hair off.

00:16:29.970 --> 00:16:34.560
My sister conceals it well, but she
has a strong personality.

00:16:35.380 --> 00:16:39.310
Even just superficially, I wanted
to resemble her.

00:16:43.400 --> 00:16:46.990
People quickly picked up
on my boyish image,

00:16:46.990 --> 00:16:49.250
and I suddenly became popular.

00:16:52.910 --> 00:16:55.650
"Girls sure are simple."

00:16:56.400 --> 00:17:01.860
I felt like I could be whatever I wanted
to be, by sheer force of will.

00:17:02.140 --> 00:17:05.010
In retrospect, I think I was pretty snobbish.

00:17:06.030 --> 00:17:10.650
Though, of course, I had the ability to
hide that part of my being as well.

00:17:13.110 --> 00:17:15.340
You joined the Drama Club?

00:17:15.340 --> 00:17:19.260
Yeah. Someone recommended I join it.

00:17:19.260 --> 00:17:22.810
I'll join the Drama Club too, then.

00:17:22.810 --> 00:17:24.420
What about drawing?

00:17:24.420 --> 00:17:27.320
I can draw by myself.

00:17:28.770 --> 00:17:30.900
Kyoko was just like me.

00:17:31.870 --> 00:17:34.890
When I cut my hair, she cut hers.

00:17:34.890 --> 00:17:36.930
She was always following me around.

00:17:37.440 --> 00:17:40.230
Sure, she was sweet, but annoying.

00:17:41.570 --> 00:17:46.830
It never occurred to me that
I was the same way.

00:17:49.580 --> 00:17:51.960
Let's pretend you didn't say that.

00:17:55.780 --> 00:17:59.300
I even changed schools to show
how heartbroken I was.

00:18:00.640 --> 00:18:05.510
Even though my family was bound to
notice my feelings for him in time,

00:18:05.510 --> 00:18:09.610
I stubbornly insisted that Sensei
and I keep them secret.

00:18:11.200 --> 00:18:15.540
I was truly a lost cause as a kid.

00:18:25.180 --> 00:18:27.320
Fumi-chan, wanna go here next?

00:18:27.350 --> 00:18:29.780
Enoshima Caves

00:18:28.030 --> 00:18:29.790
Caves!

00:18:30.080 --> 00:18:32.850
It's a little bit of a walk, though.

00:18:32.850 --> 00:18:35.880
It looks fun. I've never been
in a cave before.

00:18:35.880 --> 00:18:38.680
Me neither! I wonder what it's like.

00:18:38.680 --> 00:18:41.440
When I think of caves, it's like, umm...

00:18:41.440 --> 00:18:44.330
A god decides to hide out in a cave,

00:18:44.330 --> 00:18:48.000
then the whole world turns pitch-black,
and it's like "Holy crap!"

00:18:48.560 --> 00:18:50.770
You mean the Ama-no-Iwato myth?

00:18:51.070 --> 00:18:54.480
Amaterasu hears voices having
fun outside the cave,

00:18:54.890 --> 00:18:59.270
so she goes outside to see what's going on.
It's like something a kid would do!

00:19:01.660 --> 00:19:04.450
They say it stays open 'till five.

00:19:05.020 --> 00:19:07.190
If we go now, we'll make it in time.

00:19:07.190 --> 00:19:08.030
Shall we go?

00:19:08.530 --> 00:19:09.570
Nah, I'll pass.

00:19:09.830 --> 00:19:11.280
But you want to, don't you?

00:19:16.900 --> 00:19:17.850
Yeah.

00:19:30.700 --> 00:19:35.340
OK, everyone. Each of you grab
a candle and walk through.

00:19:36.420 --> 00:19:40.390
The ceiling gets lower as you go
along, so please be careful.

00:19:43.300 --> 00:19:44.650
It's really dark in here.

00:19:44.980 --> 00:19:47.030
You walk in front!

00:19:47.030 --> 00:19:49.070
You're the one who wanted to come here!

00:19:49.070 --> 00:19:50.390
Still...!

00:19:56.070 --> 00:19:58.730
Why did you come today?

00:20:05.300 --> 00:20:06.840
Come on, keep moving.

00:20:09.230 --> 00:20:11.370
Because I wanted to see you.

00:20:12.200 --> 00:20:14.470
I didn't want to see you.

00:20:15.380 --> 00:20:17.370
You're selfish.

00:20:17.370 --> 00:20:21.280
If you have someone you love,
please just focus on them.

00:20:22.520 --> 00:20:25.240
And what if they aren't interested?

00:20:25.850 --> 00:20:27.950
Then please give up gracefully.

00:20:31.030 --> 00:20:31.950
I've...

00:20:33.770 --> 00:20:35.410
given up on you.

00:20:41.200 --> 00:20:42.760
I'm done with you.

00:20:44.230 --> 00:20:46.790
Please grow up.

00:20:49.810 --> 00:20:50.990
OK.

00:20:56.080 --> 00:20:57.100
Fumi.

00:20:58.520 --> 00:20:59.540
I'm sorry.

00:21:06.620 --> 00:21:07.840
I'm sorry.

00:21:11.980 --> 00:21:14.780
The Happy Prince

00:21:12.330 --> 00:21:13.910
So sorry.

00:22:34.890 --> 00:22:39.870
See you next time.
